  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-11-19T07:46:44.971Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This idea is regarding a reddit post form like feature within the game, allowing the community to share and upvote ideas. This can be valuable information for you guys, if the community has a desire for premium options and features like games and private messaging or communication.\n\nInstead of guessing what may make the game more valuable. This idea could allow the community to to be more involved by allowing it be easily accessed through the game instead of a browser. \nI’ve noticed many game developers do not put a lot of attention into community feedback.\n\nMany games don’t make it easily accessible for people to share ideas and feedback. This could be potential for new ideas, premium features and implementations you guys can add to game without needing to do a lot of guessing as to what may or may not make money or work.\n\nI want to know what you think and feel about this.",
